  "description": "Our Reid Let’s range is designed to be the most accessible route to a quality eBike for all. The Let’s MOTO is your ticket to a whole load of fun without sacrificing function!\nGet ready to turn heads with the Reid Let’s MOTO, the epitome of cool in electric biking! This sleek ride, drawing inspiration from mini motocross bikes, isn’t just a mode of transportation – it’s a statement of style and adventure. Picture yourself cruising through city streets, effortlessly manoeuvring with the power of the 500W rear hub motor. Load up the rack and head out!\nThe 13ah battery gives you the load lugging range you need. As you zip through urban landscapes, imagine the thrill of tackling unexpected off-road paths, thanks to the 20×4.0″ tires and reliable disc brakes. Whether it’s conquering rugged trails or making a grand entrance at your favourite hangout spot, the MOTO is your ticket to unforgettable experiences. The Reid MOTO isn’t just a bike; it’s an invitation to redefine your ride, embrace your cool, and explore a world of thrilling possibilities.\nSo, what’s your next adventure? With the Reid MOTO, the options are limitless – your journey awaits!\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
